      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀，那個……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是名偵探瑪琪艾兒的助手，對吧？\n我以前看過<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳們兩個待在一起。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF0C90A3500B2026202600100001BE01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F540D507563A2746A742A827E5152768452A9624BFF0C5C0D5427FF1F000A62114EE5524D770B904E00100003110000FF01014F6059B350115169500B5F8557284E008D77300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是喔",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F55940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是助手嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F52A9624B55CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總之，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意幫我個忙嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D4E4BFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F5E6B6211500B5FD955CEFF1F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……把很重要的鑰匙\n交給了小鑰圈兒保管……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621120262026628A5F8891CD8981768494705319000A4EA47D664E865C0F9470570851524FDD7BA12026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我們一起出門的時候，\n小鑰圈兒牠<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n好像把鑰匙弄丟了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F621150114E008D7751FA9580768466425019FF0C000A5C0F947057085152726000100001BE00000A597D50CF628A947053195F044E1F4E862026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有頭緒嗎？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6709982D7DD255CEFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你們去了哪裡？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60501153BB4E8654EA88E1FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想想喔……我們那天應該是\n去了<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>美髮沙龍<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，那間店是第一次去，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以我不太記得位置在哪裡……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F360F35594202620266211501190A3592961C98A72662F000A53BB4E8600100002FF0000067F8E9AEE6C999F8D00100002FF000000FF0C90A395935E97662F7B2C4E006B2153BBFF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE562114E0D592A8A185F974F4D7F6E572854EA88E12026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "打理好髮型讓我很開心，\n於是我們就去了美髮沙龍附近的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>咖啡館<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>優雅地喝了茶。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62537406597D9AEE578B8B9362115F88958B5FC3FF0C000A65BC662F621150115C3153BB4E867F8E9AEE6C999F8D96448FD1768400100001BE00000A00100002FF00000654965561992800100002FF000000512A96C55730559D4E868336300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在那之後我被邀到\n咖啡館後面的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>對戰場<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n華麗地在對戰中拿下了勝利呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572890A34E4B5F8C621188AB90805230000A5496556199285F8C9762768400100002FF0000065C0D6230583400100002FF000000FF0C00100001BE00000A83EF9E97573057285C0D62304E2D62FF4E0B4E8652DD52295462300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果知道一開始的那間美髮沙龍在哪裡，\n可能也就有辦法循著當時的路線找了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C77E590534E00958B59CB768490A395937F8E9AEE6C999F8D572854EA88E1FF0C000A53EF80FD4E5F5C3167098FA66CD55FAA84577576664276848DEF7DDA627E4E862026202600100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼助手<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐，\n鑰匙就麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳去找了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC52A9624B00100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF0C000A947053195C319EBB716900100003110000FF01014F6059B353BB627E4E86300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "弄丟鑰匙那天，\n我在美髮沙龍結束後去了咖啡館，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然後去了店家後面的對戰場。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想重點應該是要先找到\n附近有咖啡館的美髮沙龍吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F044E1F9470531990A35929FF0C000A621157287F8E9AEE6C999F8D7D50675F5F8C53BB4E86549655619928FF0C00100001BE00000A71365F8C53BB4E865E975BB65F8C976276845C0D62305834300200100001BE01000A621160F391CD9EDE61C98A72662F89815148627E5230000A96448FD1670954965561992876847F8E9AEE6C999F8D5427300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "發現了豪華的鑰匙！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "767C73FE4E868C6A83EF768494705319FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "助手<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐！我想起我是在\n這個對戰場對戰的了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52A9624B00100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D0FF01621160F38D776211662F5728000A9019500B5C0D623058345C0D623076844E86300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～！\n那是我的鑰匙！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5EFF01000A90A3662F6211768494705319FF0100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "奇奇……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59475947202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小鑰圈兒，\n弄丟鑰匙並不是你的責任，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n而是來這裡的我的責任喔。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F947057085152FF0C000A5F044E1F947053194E264E0D662F4F6076848CAC4EFBFF0C00100001BE00000A800C662F4F86901988E17684621176848CAC4EFB5594300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "奇奇？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59475947FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是我聽說如果是鑰圈兒喜歡的鑰匙，\n牠是絕對不會放手的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F6211807D8AAA5982679C662F947057085152559C6B61768494705319FF0C000A7260662F7D555C0D4E0D6703653E624B7684300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以小鑰圈兒，\n我決定以後會把你喜歡的鑰匙<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n交給你保管。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C0F947057085152FF0C000A62116C7A5B9A4EE55F8C6703628A4F60559C6B6176849470531900100001BE00000A4EA47D664F604FDD7BA1300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而其他的鑰匙\n我會負起責任保管的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C51764ED6768494705319000A621167038CA08D778CAC4EFB4FDD7BA17684300200100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "奇奇♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59475947266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這麼一來，小鑰圈兒和我\n就各自分擔一半的職責囉！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90199EBC4E004F86FF0C5C0F947057085152548C6211000A5C31540481EA520664D44E00534A768480778CAC56C9FF0100100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳，助手<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ先生小姐。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意收下這份謝禮嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C52A9624B00100003110000FF02025148751F5C0F59D03002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F65364E0B90194EFD8B1D79AE55CEFF1F00100002011401770000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，再會了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕŷ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
